  "_comment": "CVS training HW/SW support matrix. One file for all training frameworks. Deny-list semantics: an entry lists only what is UNSUPPORTED; anything not listed (including future GPU archs) is allowed. Enforcement is controlled by the CVS_SUPPORT_MATRIX_GATE environment variable (see README.md). jaxmaxtext carries data; other frameworks have empty model templates for their owners to fill. Batch/GBS/tok-s are performance values (NOT support signals) and are not stored here.",
